stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unknown
  Unknown: No one named
  Waiting: Waiting on a verified person with reason and evidence
  Cleared: Wait cleared, previous wait retained in audit
  Completed: Item completed, waiting cleared
  Unknown --> Waiting: Name a person
  Waiting --> Waiting: Replace the person or reason
  Waiting --> Cleared: Clear the wait
  Cleared --> Waiting: Name a person again
  Waiting --> Completed: Complete underlying work
  Unknown --> Completed: Complete underlying work
  Cleared --> Completed: Complete underlying work
  Waiting --> Waiting: Retry exact command, no second change
  Waiting --> Waiting: Refuse stale version or invalid identity
  Unknown --> Unknown: Refuse merged, deleted, unknown or foreign identity
  Completed --> Completed: Refuse a new wait
  %% never A read changes stored waiting state
  %% never Naming a person changes action ownership
  %% never A deleted party displays a stale name
  %% never A foreign tenant reads or changes internal waits
